+/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics.k-29-//   semantics/call.k           MPY-CALL         ALL Call routing + argument evaluation
+/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics.k:30://   semantics/sort.k           MPY-SORT         trusted sorted(): opaque sortVS + concrete insertion sort
+/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics.k-31-//   semantics/assert.k         MPY-ASSERT       Assert oracle (smoke programs only)
