+/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/sort.k-1-// reference/src/semantics/sort.k — MPY-SORT
+/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/sort.k:2:// Trusted sorted(): sorted(list) as an opaque ascending permutation `sortVS` — opaque symbolic
