+/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics.k-27-//   semantics/functions.k      MPY-FUNCTIONS    def / call / return (frame stack)
+/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics.k-28-//   semantics/builtins.k       MPY-BUILTINS     builtins as calls: len/sum/abs/min/max/ord/chr/str
